                                        "entry_id": "2fcd547d-fc53-3404-a624-555334a38553",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The goddess of beauty and love, born when Cronus castrated his father, Uranus, and threw his genitalia into the sea."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Greek"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
