                                                "sense_id": "d1bd00f2-1065-3aa3-bf15-a7d5de55dc2e",
                                                "text": "In the \"Iliad\", Aphrodite is represented as the daughter of Zeus and Dione, the goddess of moisture, who, as the wife of the god of heaven, was held in high esteem among the old Pelasgians."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
